IMAPStore gmail-remote
AuthMechs LOGIN
Host imap.gmail.com
User johannes.wikner@gmail.com
PassCmd "/opt/homebrew/bin/pass gmail/app-password"
TLSType IMAPS

MaildirStore gmail-local
Path ~/Mail/gmail/
Inbox ~/Mail/gmail/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel gmail
Far :gmail-remote:
Near :gmail-local:
Patterns INBOX [Gmail]/Sent\ Mail [Gmail]/Drafts [Gmail]/Trash
MaxMessages 500
ExpireUnread yes
Expunge Both
Create Near
SyncState *
